<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Soufiane Aberbach — Fashion Designer &amp; Product Developer</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wdth,wght@75..125,400..900&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style is:inline>
:root{
  --paper:#FFFFFF;   /* pure white everywhere - photo blends with no visible box */
  --ink:#141412;
  --mute:#6C6C65;
  --line:#E4E2DE;
  --accent:#C08552;  /* single accent */
  --pad:22px;
}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;
 -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow-x:hidden}
img{display:block;max-width:100%}
.mono{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.15em;
 text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--mute)}
.disp{font-family:Archivo,sans-serif;font-variation-settings:'wdth' 112;font-weight:800;
 letter-spacing:-.035em;line-height:.92}

/* ---------------- nav ---------------- */
nav{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:60;display:flex;align-items:center;
 justify-content:space-between;padding:15px var(--pad);
 background:rgba(255,255,255,0);border-bottom:1px solid transparent;transition:.35s}
nav.stuck{background:rgba(255,255,255,.9);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);border-bottom-color:var(--line)}
.logo{font-family:Archivo,sans-serif;font-variation-settings:'wdth' 125;font-weight:900;
 font-size:19px;letter-spacing:-.05em}
.logo b{color:var(--accent)}
.links{display:none}
.burger{width:40px;height:40px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;
 gap:5px;align-items:flex-end;background:none;border:0}
.burger i{height:1.6px;background:var(--ink)}
.burger i:first-child{width:21px}.burger i:last-child{width:13px}
@media(min-width:900px){.burger{display:none}.links{display:flex;gap:28px}
 .links a{color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;
  font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;padding-bottom:4px;
  border-bottom:1px solid transparent;transition:.3s}
 .links a:hover,.links a.on{border-bottom-color:var(--accent)}}

/* ---------------- hero : copy LEFT, photo RIGHT ---------------- */
header{min-height:100svh;display:flex;align-items:center;padding:96px var(--pad) 32px}
.hero{width:100%;max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px}
.hcopy{order:1}
.photo{order:2;align-self:flex-end;width:82%;max-width:360px;
 opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px);transition:1s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) .35s}
.photo.in{opacity:1;transform:none}
.hello{margin-bottom:10px}
.name{font-size:clamp(40px,11.5vw,86px);text-transform:uppercase}
.name .ln{display:block;overflow:hidden}
.name .ln>span{display:block;transform:translateY(108%);
 transition:transform 1.05s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}
.name.in .ln>span{transform:translateY(0)}
.name .ln:nth-child(2)>span{transition-delay:.09s}
.role{margin-top:16px;font-family:Archivo,sans-serif;font-variation-settings:'wdth' 108;
 font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(20px,5.4vw,32px);letter-spacing:-.02em;min-height:1.35em}
#rw{color:var(--accent)}
.caret{display:inline-block;width:2px;height:.95em;background:var(--accent);
 vertical-align:-.12em;margin-left:3px;animation:bl 1s steps(1) infinite}
@keyframes bl{50%{opacity:0}}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;
 text-decoration:none;padding:16px 26px;margin-top:26px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;
 font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;transition:.25s}
.btn:hover{background:var(--ink)}
@media(min-width:900px){
 .hero{flex-direction:row;align-items:center;gap:56px}
 .hcopy{order:1;flex:1}
 .photo{order:2;width:44%;max-width:500px;align-self:center}}

/* ---------------- reveal ---------------- */
.rv{opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px);transition:opacity .8s ease,transform .8s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}
.rv.in{opacity:1;transform:none}
section{padding:88px var(--pad);max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto}
.eb{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;margin-bottom:22px}
.eb:before{content:"";width:24px;height:1px;background:var(--accent)}
h2{font-family:Archivo,sans-serif;font-variation-settings:'wdth' 110;font-weight:800;
 letter-spacing:-.032em;line-height:1.03;font-size:clamp(30px,7.6vw,54px)}
p.body{color:#4E4E48;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;margin-top:16px;max-width:56ch}

/* ---------------- numbers ---------------- */
.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;background:var(--line);
 border-block:1px solid var(--line)}
.stat{background:var(--paper);padding:26px 19px}
.stat b{display:block;font-family:Archivo,sans-serif;font-variation-settings:'wdth' 115;
 font-weight:800;font-size:38px;letter-spacing:-.045em;line-height:1;color:var(--accent)}
.stat span{display:block;margin-top:9px}
@media(min-width:900px){.stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}}

/* ---------------- statement band ---------------- */
.say{background:var(--ink);color:#F2F2EF;max-width:none;padding-block:96px}
.say .inner{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto}
.say q{font-family:Archivo,sans-serif;font-variation-settings:'wdth' 108;font-weight:700;
 font-size:clamp(26px,6.4vw,46px);line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-.03em;quotes:none;display:block}
.say q em{color:var(--accent);font-style:normal}
.say p{color:#9C9C93;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.65;margin-top:22px;max-width:52ch}

/* ---------------- stages : stacking cards ---------------- */
.stages{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 var(--pad) 88px}
.stage{position:sticky;top:96px;margin-bottom:26px;
 border-radius:2px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--ink);
 box-shadow:0 -1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.06);
 transform:translateY(40px) scale(.97);opacity:0;
 transition:transform .9s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1),opacity .7s ease}
.stage.in{transform:none;opacity:1}
.stage-media{position:relative;aspect-ratio:4/5}
.stage-media:after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;
 background:linear-gradient(to top,rgba(12,12,10,.92) 4%,rgba(12,12,10,.15) 62%,rgba(12,12,10,.45))}
.stage-media img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;filter:grayscale(.55) brightness(.92)}
.stage-copy{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:2;padding:26px 24px 30px;color:#fff}
.s-num{color:var(--accent)!important;display:block;margin-bottom:8px}
.stage-copy h3{font-family:Archivo,sans-serif;font-variation-settings:'wdth' 110;font-weight:800;
 font-size:clamp(28px,7.4vw,46px);letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1}
.stage-copy p{color:#D2D2CC;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;margin-top:12px;max-width:46ch}
@media(min-width:900px){
 .stage{top:110px;margin-bottom:34px}
 .stage-media{aspect-ratio:16/8}
 .stage-copy{padding:44px 48px 46px}}

/* ---------------- brand marquee ---------------- */
.marq{max-width:none;padding:0;overflow:hidden;
 border-block:1px solid var(--line);
 -webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#000 12%,#000 88%,transparent);
 mask-image:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#000 12%,#000 88%,transparent)}
.track{display:flex;width:max-content;animation:sc 42s linear infinite}
.marq:hover .track{animation-play-state:paused}
@keyframes sc{to{transform:translateX(-50%)}}
/* each .slot is a LOGO PLACEHOLDER - replace <i>Name</i> with <img src="/logos/name.svg"> */
.slot{flex:none;width:172px;height:88px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
 border-right:1px solid var(--line)}
.slot i{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;
 letter-spacing:.08em;color:#8C8C85;text-align:center;padding:0 12px;
 transition:color .3s}
.slot:hover i{color:var(--ink)}
.slot img{max-width:110px;max-height:44px;object-fit:contain;
 filter:grayscale(1) opacity(.55);transition:filter .3s}
.slot:hover img{filter:none}

/* ---------------- cta ---------------- */
footer{padding:34px var(--pad) 48px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);
 display:flex;justify-content:space-between;max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
 *{transition:none!important;animation:none!important}
 .rv,.photo,.stage{opacity:1;transform:none}.name .ln>span{transform:none}
 .stage{position:static}}


/* ---- about : magazine-style text wrap around the cutout ---- */
.about{max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;padding:130px var(--pad) 100px}
.about .eb{margin-bottom:8px}

.wrapfig{
  float:right;
  width:44%;
  max-width:400px;
  margin:6px 0 20px 30px;
  shape-margin:22px;
  shape-outside:var(--shape);
  -webkit-shape-image-threshold:0.08;
  shape-image-threshold:0.08;
}
.wrapfig img{width:100%;display:block}
@media(max-width:760px){
  .wrapfig{float:none;width:78%;max-width:320px;margin:0 auto 28px;shape-outside:none}
}

.abig{font-family:Archivo,sans-serif;font-variation-settings:'wdth' 118;font-weight:900;
 text-transform:lowercase;letter-spacing:-.045em;line-height:.86;color:var(--ink);
 font-size:clamp(46px,9vw,80px);margin:8px 0 22px}
.abig em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent)}

.about p{font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.68;color:#333330;margin-bottom:16px}
.about p b{font-weight:600;color:var(--ink)}

.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:22px 0 26px;clear:none}
.chips span{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.06em;
 border:1px solid var(--line);padding:7px 11px;color:#3A3A35}

.found{border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:8px;padding-top:20px;
 display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.found div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;font-size:14px}
.found b{font-weight:500}
.found span{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--mute);
 text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;flex:none}

.notdo{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--mute);
 margin-top:22px;line-height:1.7}
.notdo b{color:#4E4E48;font-weight:500}

.clearfix::after{content:"";display:block;clear:both}

:root{--shape:url('data:image/png;base64,')}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<nav id="nav">
  <div class="logo">SA<b>.</b></div>
  <div class="links">
    <a class="on" href="/">Home</a><a href="/expertise/">Expertise</a><a href="/portfolio/">Portfolio</a>
    <a href="/process/">Process</a><a href="/experience/">Experience</a><a href="/contact/">Contact</a>
  </div>
  <button class="burger" aria-label="Menu"><i></i><i></i></button>
</nav>

<div class="about">
  <div class="eb rv"><span class="mono">About me</span></div>
  <h1 class="abig rv">about <em>me</em>.</h1>

  <div class="clearfix">
    <figure class="wrapfig rv"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Soufiane Aberbach"></figure>

    <p>I'm Soufiane &mdash; a senior fashion designer and product developer based in Tangier. Over <b>11 years</b> I've taken more than <b>8,500 garments</b> from sketch to a specification a factory can actually produce.</p>

    <p>I've worked across four roles &mdash; <b>Ava Marie</b> (current), <b>Lariconf</b>, <b>Loratex</b> and <b>Roadtex</b> &mdash; moving from pattern-room execution to owning full development end to end: sketch, pattern, grading, 3D fit, tech pack, and staying on the line through bulk.</p>

    <p>That work has fed manufacturing programmes for major European and North American retailers, through Ava Marie's contracts &mdash; project exposure, not direct employment or endorsement.</p>

    <p>My job is invisible in the finished piece. It's the decision made before the fabric was cut.</p>

    <div class="chips">
      <span>Gerber AccuMark</span><span>Lectra</span><span>Optitex</span>
      <span>CLO3D</span><span>Vetigraph</span><span>Adobe Illustrator</span>
    </div>

    <div class="found">
      <div><b>Diploma in Fashion Design</b><span>Coll&egrave;ge La Salle &middot; 2014</span></div>
      <div><b>Diploma in Administrative Management</b><span>CIEL &middot; 2018</span></div>
    </div>

    <p class="notdo"><b>Not on the list:</b> collection design, fabric sourcing, branding, sample sewing.</p>
  </div>

  <a class="btn rv" href="/contact/" style="margin-top:36px">Start a development brief &rarr;</a>
</div>

<footer><span class="mono">Soufiane Aberbach &middot; Tangier</span><span class="mono">&copy; 2026</span></footer>
<script is:inline>
const nav=document.getElementById('nav');
addEventListener('scroll',()=>nav.classList.toggle('stuck',scrollY>50),{passive:true});
const io=new IntersectionObserver(es=>es.forEach((e,i)=>{
  if(e.isIntersecting){setTimeout(()=>e.target.classList.add('in'),i*85);io.unobserve(e.target)}
}),{threshold:.15});
document.querySelectorAll('.rv').forEach(e=>io.observe(e));
</script>
</body>
</html>
